  "forbidden_attributes": ["payload", "sql", "terminal_bytes", "secret", "token", "A_value_dump"],
  "word_id_join": "t2.scm.word_id is an attribute join, not an OTEL SpanLink.",
  "notes": "Successful publication is inherited t2.scm.publish. Capture enqueue has no general span. Capacity rejection is t2_scm_shadow_rejected_capacity_total plus bounded overload start/recovery episodes. Fault allowlist is exact five keys: required fault_code + waker_state; identity attrs omitted when no associated occurrence (never fabricate). Optional means omit key, not accept arbitrary attributes."
